{"seq":85,"slug":"consistent-hashing","title":"一致性哈希与数据分布","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"一致性哈希与数据分布\">一致性哈希与数据分布</h1><p>把一份数据集切成上千个分片、摊到一群机器上，本来是一件平淡无奇的事——直到你发现机器会坏、会扩容、会缩容。每一次节点数量变化，都可能让你辛苦建立的「键到机器」映射全盘失效，进而触发整库的数据搬迁。一致性哈希要解决的，正是这一个具体而尖锐的问题：当集群从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 台变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 台时，如何让被迫迁移的键只占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(n+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 那么一小撮，而不是几乎全部。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿四条主线递进，每一条都在为下一条铺路。</p>\n<p>第一条线是「基础」。它先回答为什么单机放不下、为什么要做数据分布，再把朴素的取模哈希拉出来示众——正是 <code>hash(key) % n</code> 里那个会变的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，导致扩容时几乎所有键的归属都改变。看清这个痛点之后，一致性哈希的四条核心性质（均衡、单调、分散、负载）才显得顺理成章。</p>\n<p>第二条线是「核心技术」。哈希环把节点和键映射到同一个环形空间，键顺时针归属于第一个节点，于是增删节点只影响相邻一段弧。虚拟节点用「一台物理机对应环上多个点」抹平单调环带来的负载倾斜。Rendezvous（最高随机权重）则换一条完全不同的思路：不用环，给每个节点算分、取最大，天然支持加权且实现极简。</p>\n<p>第三条线是「进阶」。有界负载给环加上一个容量上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1+\\varepsilon)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，溢出的键顺延到下一个节点，从而把热点摊平——Google 把它用进 Cloud Pub/Sub，Vimeo 把它写进 HAProxy 后缓存带宽降到约原来的八分之一。Jump 哈希用五行代码、零存储实现近乎完美的均衡，代价是节点必须顺序编号。加权分布则把「机器配置不同」这件现实纳入所有方案。</p>\n<p>第四条线是「工程实践」。复制与放置决定一个键的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本落在环上的哪几台机器、如何构造 preference list 跳过同机架同可用区。再平衡处理节点加入、退出、临时故障时的数据流动与 hinted handoff。最后的系统与陷阱把 Cassandra、DynamoDB、Maglev、HAProxy 的真实选型摆在一起，并列出热点、抖动、虚拟节点数量失当等踩坑点。</p>\n<p>读完整个 hub，你应当能在面对一个真实的分布式存储或负载均衡问题时，判断该用环、用 Rendezvous 还是用 Jump，该配多少虚拟节点，该如何在节点变动时把迁移量压到理论下界。建议按章节顺序阅读，因为后面每一篇都假定你已经掌握了前面建立的概念与记号。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-data-distribution","title":"为什么需要数据分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/why-data-distribution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"naive-hashing-problem","title":"朴素哈希的问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/naive-hashing-problem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistent-hashing-basics","title":"一致性哈希基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/foundations/consistent-hashing-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"核心技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hash-ring","title":"哈希环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/hash-ring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-nodes","title":"虚拟节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/virtual-nodes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendezvous-hashing","title":"Rendezvous 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/rendezvous-hashing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bounded-loads","title":"有界负载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/bounded-loads"},{"seq":2,"slug":"jump-hash","title":"Jump 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/jump-hash"},{"seq":3,"slug":"weighted-distribution","title":"加权分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/weighted-distribution"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-placement","title":"复制与放置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice/replication-placement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rebalancing","title":"再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice/rebalancing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems-pitfalls","title":"系统与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice/systems-pitfalls"}]}]}